      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now coeliac disease on a gluten-free diet with some accidental exposure is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get a blood count, for coeliac follow-up. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more.",
